        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left shoulder pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Left lateral/posterior shoulder ache for approximately 5/7. Pain 6/10 with movement and 2/10 at rest; wakes patient 1–2 times per night. Pain increases with abduction above approximately 90°, reaching behind the back, overhead work, and lying on the left side. Pain is clearly movement-related and not exertional. No clear trauma."
      }
    },
